<title>INDIA: India's 96/97 cotton crop seen at 14.16 mln bales.</title>
<headline>India's 96/97 cotton crop seen at 14.16 mln bales.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Agriculture Ministry on Thursday estimated the country's 96/97 (June-May) cotton crop at 14.16 million bales compared with 13.09 million bales, an official statement said.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi +91-11- 301 2024</p>
</text>
